    "ja": "あなざー。デッドマン・ワンダーランド"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "We loved the inmates of Deadman Wonderland. And now we can laugh with them!\n\nTrue to the motto \"Boredom does not exist,\" Mangaka Mizuno Moto brings the slightly different everyday life of the inmates of Deadman Wonderland with a lot of humor and love on paper. The focus is on the small Shiro, who, with her ignorant nature, ensures a lot of chaos and keeps everyone on track! Whether it is an excursion to the sea, celebrating Halloween or making chocolate, everything becomes a special experience, which no one will ever forget!"
  },
